<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Song of Songs depicts our story with God</l><l>Of fallen man with the King of kings.</l><l>Because of His love for us,</l><l>He became a lowly man</l><l>To reach us and to die for our sins.</l><l>Then in resurrection He</l><l>Regenerated me</l><l>And now we’re daily being transformed.</l><l>To become the same as He with His life and nature</l><l>To become His counterpart, His match and bride.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
